{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A robot awakens, finding itself in a digital wasteland ravaged by a virus. POOL is a sci-fi adventure puzzle game that combines exploration, puzzles, and storytelling to gradually unveil the secrets behind these ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905880/extras/5de9b5aa71905ad4bdf016fc96fbd6ae.poster.avif?t=1759978911\" width=614 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905880/extras/5de9b5aa71905ad4bdf016fc96fbd6ae.webm?t=1759978911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905880/extras/5de9b5aa71905ad4bdf016fc96fbd6ae.mp4?t=1759978911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Solitary and Enigmatic Journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One robot, one desolate and shattered world. No clamor of human voices, only the low hum of the wind blowing through the ruins and the faint buzz from a distant past. You are the only \u201clife\u201d in this wasteland, bearing a mission: to piece together the truth of this world\u2019s collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905880/extras/eb78ea66a256368297d5395bec7803aa.poster.avif?t=1759978911\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905880/extras/eb78ea66a256368297d5395bec7803aa.webm?t=1759978911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905880/extras/eb78ea66a256368297d5395bec7803aa.mp4?t=1759978911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Forgotten World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will navigate through crumbling buildings and rusted machinery, using a neural data cable to decrypt the \u201cData Fragments\u201d scattered throughout. These fragments are like remnants of time\u2014sometimes the last glimmer of human hope, sometimes unsettling whispers of despair. Even stranger are the \u201cData Echoes\u201d\u2014emotional remnants of the departed. These echoes seep into your core, blurring the line between memory and illusion. Can you stay sane, or will this wasteland consume you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905880/extras/edc3c5116ecc2ad3f5b30ccd5015d2bb.poster.avif?t=1759978911\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905880/extras/edc3c5116ecc2ad3f5b30ccd5015d2bb.webm?t=1759978911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905880/extras/edc3c5116ecc2ad3f5b30ccd5015d2bb.mp4?t=1759978911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Battle of Survival and Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faced with threats lurking in the shadows, you must remain ever vigilant. Yet even so, every step is an adventure, every choice a matter of life or death. Will you press forward, or choose to retreat? This wasteland watches you\u2014it never forgives mistakes.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collecting Parts and Chips to Strengthen Yourself</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Using the Neural Data Cable to Infiltrate Devices</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Storyline</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectible \u201cData Echoes\u201d</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Labor of One</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a dream crafted single-handedly by an independent developer with sweat and passion. From every line of code to every design detail, it\u2019s infused with heart and perseverance. This is more than a game\u2014it\u2019s a growing story\u2014and you can be a part of it. Join our community, shape this world with me, and explore profound questions about humanity and the future: when machines rule all, are we still \u201cus\u201d?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3905880?t=1759978911","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905880/d992985e098de50d21bb308984dc296cccbb08ba/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759978911","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905880/ade061c69876c3c831ac35ee89ece36cacd49143/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759978911","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905880/ade061c69876c3c831ac35ee89ece36cacd49143/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759978911","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3947580,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A robot awakens, finding itself in a digital wasteland ravaged by a virus. POOL is a sci-fi adventure puzzle game that combines exploration, puzzles, and storytelling to gradually unveil the secrets behind these ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905880/extras/5de9b5aa71905ad4bdf0